  "description": "*“This is all Dad's fault!!”*\n\nThe year is 2026. Kang-Kwon, who takes after his father, is a frail 159 cm tall and weighs just 51 kg. After being bullied at school every day, he falls from the rooftop. In 1996, Kang-Kwon wakes up in the body of his uncle, Choi Kang-Kwon, who stands 188 cm tall and weighs 71 kg. Dad’s best friend. But contrary to expectations, Uncle Choi Kang-Kwon was actually a total loser who got bullied... \n\nNow taller but still a loser, (Choi) Kang-kwon’s very difficult (?) high school life in 1996 begins.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
